    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>ROADMAP:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<span class=\"bb_strike\">Prologue</span>(Completed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<span class=\"bb_strike\">Chapter 1</span>(Completed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<span class=\"bb_strike\">Chapter 2</span>(Completed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<span class=\"bb_strike\">The Western</span> Dream(Completed)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Chapter 3(Under Construction)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Chapter 4(Soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Another Dream(Soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Chapter 5(Soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Chapter 6(Soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Another Dream(Soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Finale(Soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/074e4d9c14c3ab94ded967f0f1b61e51.poster.avif?t=1752770549\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/074e4d9c14c3ab94ded967f0f1b61e51.webm?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/074e4d9c14c3ab94ded967f0f1b61e51.mp4?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the Story with Your Choices:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new ice age slowly pushes the world toward extinction, witness the experiences of the Narrator, one of the few remaining survivors. In this choice-driven game, you will determine the fate of the character telling the story and how it all ends. In a world on the brink of destruction, where loneliness has become a form of madness, decide what the Narrator will do under conditions no sane person could endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/8b5a39bf50e1f68a480fdb4e2c339ada.poster.avif?t=1752770549\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/8b5a39bf50e1f68a480fdb4e2c339ada.webm?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/8b5a39bf50e1f68a480fdb4e2c339ada.mp4?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can keep your body warm, but can you protect your mind from the cold?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the winter that brought the apocalypse and the solitude of an abandoned world. The journey of the Narrator, seemingly impossible yet somehow real, is in your hands. Shape the course of the story with your choices. While doing so, try to preserve both the Narrator\u2019s sanity and your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/98101904b157629dd4863b1cfe9f9204.poster.avif?t=1752770549\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/98101904b157629dd4863b1cfe9f9204.webm?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/98101904b157629dd4863b1cfe9f9204.mp4?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do whatever it takes to protect the Narrator from hunger and cold.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Narrator\u2019s vital stats may limit your choices or open new paths. Can he fight if he\u2019s not brave enough? Can he stay sane if he\u2019s too hungry? Can he even survive if he hasn\u2019t lost his mind just enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage limited resources wisely to ensure he doesn\u2019t lose his sanity entirely\u2014or just enough to survive. Search for hidden objects, make the right choices, or simply rely on luck to stock up on food, fuel, water, and other essential supplies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/b6dcf0a1538d460b0ed6be9e79d584f3.poster.avif?t=1752770549\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/b6dcf0a1538d460b0ed6be9e79d584f3.webm?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/b6dcf0a1538d460b0ed6be9e79d584f3.mp4?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover the remnants of the old world:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover artifacts buried beneath the ruins and junk heaps. Unravel their secrets and experience the stories of a world long gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/68aa55f59a6fb5b154d9ec74e01094a4.poster.avif?t=1752770549\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/68aa55f59a6fb5b154d9ec74e01094a4.webm?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491700/extras/68aa55f59a6fb5b154d9ec74e01094a4.mp4?t=1752770549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the Narrator\u2019s dreams:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;They say a madman's dreams are just as mad as he is.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Narrator\u2019s dreams, where each one opens the door to a completely different fantasy world. Experience surreal tales far removed from reality. Make the right choices to ensure the dreams reach their proper conclusions and gain advantages that will impact the Narrator\u2019s true story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your skills in various mini-games, from turn-based combat to high-stakes Wild West duels.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove the Narrator\u2019s abilities, earn rewards, uncover hidden objects in the scenes, learn new skills, and use them to overcome the challenges you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GAME IS CURRENTLY IN EARLY ACCESS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reporting any bugs or issues you encounter will greatly contribute to the development process.</p>",
